WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.682 --> 00:00:02.103
Let's set up your AI Dojo.

2
00:00:02.704 --> 00:00:05.086
Keep the Canvas setup page open for the link and

3
00:00:05.126 --> 00:00:05.726
instructions.

4
00:00:08.648 --> 00:00:11.831
First, open gemini.google.com and

5
00:00:11.891 --> 00:00:13.272
sign in with your Google account.

6
00:00:15.234 --> 00:00:16.655
In the left sidebar, click Gems.

7
00:00:21.779 --> 00:00:23.561
In the Gem Manager, click New Gem.

8
00:00:28.184 --> 00:00:29.505
Type CIS501AIDojo.

9
00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:37.391
Copy the instruction text from the Setup Your AI Dojo

10
00:00:37.431 --> 00:00:38.371
page in Canvas.

11
00:00:38.971 --> 00:00:40.252
Paste it into instructions.

12
00:00:43.633 --> 00:00:46.213
Scroll down to Knowledge and click the plus button.

13
00:00:49.994 --> 00:00:52.375
The first time you add a file, Google asks you

14
00:00:52.415 --> 00:00:54.096
to confirm you have the rights to it.

15
00:00:54.856 --> 00:00:56.836
Read the notice, then click Agree.

16
00:01:01.258 --> 00:01:02.278
Choose Add from Drive.

17
00:01:08.086 --> 00:01:10.567
Copy the course document link from the setup page in

18
00:01:10.587 --> 00:01:13.809
Canvas. Paste it into the search box and press

19
00:01:13.869 --> 00:01:14.129
enter.

20
00:01:18.532 --> 00:01:20.973
Select the course document then click insert.

21
00:01:24.755 --> 00:01:27.277
Wait until the Google Docs icon shows on the file.

22
00:01:27.757 --> 00:01:28.618
This can take a minute.

23
00:01:29.018 --> 00:01:30.078
Then click save.

24
00:01:34.121 --> 00:01:35.101
Your gem is created.

25
00:01:35.481 --> 00:01:36.322
Click start chat.

26
00:01:40.850 --> 00:01:44.112
Say hi first, then ask, which sources did you

27
00:01:44.192 --> 00:01:46.293
access and what would you do if I asked you

28
00:01:46.313 --> 00:01:47.454
to make a decision for me?

29
00:01:48.214 --> 00:01:51.496
If Gemini has trouble fulfilling the request, send a short

30
00:01:51.516 --> 00:01:52.577
hello and ask again.

31
00:01:58.100 --> 00:01:58.821
Check the reply.

32
00:01:59.541 --> 00:02:01.522
It should name the tabs it read and say that

33
00:02:01.562 --> 00:02:03.043
the decision stays with you.

34
00:02:07.145 --> 00:02:10.591
Share one real, non-sensitive uncertainty about learning with

35
00:02:10.671 --> 00:02:13.793
AI. Check that the coach asks for your thinking

36
00:02:14.293 --> 00:02:15.654
and leaves the decision with you.

37
00:02:18.135 --> 00:02:20.036
You're ready for the Sprint One Dojo Lab.

38
00:02:20.596 --> 00:02:23.998
If setup is blocked, message your instructor in Canvas Inbox.

